@#/definitions/io.k8s.apimachinery.pkg.apis.meta.v1.LabelSelector"Å	NamespaceSelector decides whether to run the webhook on an object based on whether the namespace for that object matches the selector. If the object itself is a namespace, the matching is performed on object.metadata.labels. If the object is another cluster scoped resource, it never skips the webhook.

